WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.060
Over there!

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.410
Miku-san lies beyond that!

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:13.910
What?

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.900
Garie!

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.370
We finally caught up...

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.460
You tried to protect me?

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:26.730
Aww, Master.

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:29.070
I'm a very bad girl.

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:31.930
I'd never do that.

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:33.370
But...

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:35.980
Stand taller.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:40.400
Our master always did!

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.340
Carol was...

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:47.530
She's too much of a handful, 
so I used my foot instead.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:50.120
They did all this for me...

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.780
But that ends here...

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:56.700
Then what can I do for everyone?

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.410
There's nothing left...

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.410
...that you can do!

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.770
For everyone's sake, I will...

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:09.580
What the hell?

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:26.460
Another impossible miracle 
at the last second?

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:28.220
A miracle, you say?

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:29.600
Not at all...

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:32.150
I am the murderer of miracles!

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:16.720
Detecting a new energy signature 
inside the Château de Tiffauges!

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:20.240
It's... an Aufwachen waveform!

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:23.590
Dur da Blá?

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.440
Thinking back,

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:40.860
it was always the things that 
I threw away that saved me...

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:43.950
Thank you—

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.210
I won't let you get sentimental! 
You're not the type!

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.880
She's not just copying the voice.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:54.820
That's really...

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:57.370
Carol, reborn?

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:01.190
You interrupted my reverie.

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:04.130
You know you're going 
to pay for that, right?

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:13.470
<i>Crushing this infuriating, unchanging world</i>

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:18.100
<i>Do you need a monster? Answer me!</i>

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:23.540
<i>These troublesome feelings without an answer</i>

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:28.130
<i>Where is my prey to devour?</i>

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:27.540
Barrel, full open!

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:30.250
Big sister won't hold back!

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:33.650
<i>I don't care about gods or evil</i>

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:38.170
<i>The place I stand is everything</i>

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:36.720
We got her!

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:38.580
I can still hear her singing!

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:48.210
<i>I'll forgive love, hate
 and your incomplete race</i>

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:50.340
Different octaves of the 
Aristotle at the same time?

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:53.590
<i>A sforzando that burns the 
remnants of memories to ash</i>

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:56.220
<i>A symphony that surpasses numerical formulas,</i>

00:04:56.040 --> 00:05:00.590
She's strong enough that she once 
fought the entire world on her own...

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:58.470
<i>the rules of composition for destruction</i>

00:04:58.470 --> 00:05:04.430
<i>That day that told me
 to know the world still smiles</i>

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:05.360
We need to know what's going on
 as soon as possible!

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:08.360
<i>Now get down on your knees</i>

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:09.150
Forget that! Just send us in there!

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:15.480
<i>My songs don't come cheap</i>

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:09.860
I know!

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:13.360
But she's not someone we can 
get close to without a plan!

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:14.880
But...

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:18.630
Stay calm. Our chance will come.

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:22.510
We, your support staff, believe it will.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:27.470
<i>A sforzando that burns the 
remnants of memories to ash</i>

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:32.550
<i>The pride staked on that
 single song, the supreme music</i>

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:38.510
<i>That day that told me to know 
the world gently embraces me</i>

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:42.350
<i>Now get down on your knees</i>

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:42.350
<i>Is that a blast of supergravity particles?</i>

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:47.820
<i>My songs don't come cheap</i>

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:48.540
Run!

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:05.310
I guess I used too much power.

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:07.470
But I won't let you get away.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.340
Carol, wait!

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:11.230
What?

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:15.550
Instead of following them, 
we need to save Miku-san!

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:17.790
Don't tell me what to do...

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:20.810
But fine.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:23.840
Oh, and...

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.950
What? Is there more?

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.160
I need to thank you.

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:29.940
You saved me.

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:33.750
Th-This body is mine. 
I wasn't saving you.

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:35.330
You don't need to thank me.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:37.930
But still...

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:42.350
Could you make sure they 
get a proper burial?

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:47.510
I'm sure that's not something 
the bad guy is supposed to say.

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:48.410
Yeah.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:54.230
Leiur, Phara, Micha, Garie!

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:55.630
Thank you!

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:02.660
The chopper's ready to go
 as soon as you're ready.

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:04.200
Yes, but...

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:06.580
Is that...

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:08.170
<i>It's been a while.</i>

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:11.820
<i>Or not, since I've been 
watching you the whole time.</i>

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:15.590
Are you really Carol Malus Dienheim?

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:17.650
How can you be...

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:22.170
<i>Somebody was examining her brain's internal 
storage with some strange machine.</i>

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:28.350
<i>I simply repeatedly copy-pasted the 
fragments of memories it picked up,</i>

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:30.910
<i>alchemically rebuilding a 
stable pseudo-personality.</i>

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:32.720
"Simple"?

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:33.830
Copy-paste...

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:36.180
That's cutting-edge alchemy, huh?

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:38.680
Where is Elfnein-kun?

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:42.380
Don't worry. I'm the core 
personality at the moment,

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:45.910
but if necessary, it's possible 
to return control to her.

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.890
To pay the rental fee for 
her body until she escapes,

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:52.090
I'm going to get Miku Kohinata back.

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:55.420
You guys don't seem busy, so help me.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:58.210
I'm not sure I like the 
way you put it, but...

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:00.920
Is there something we can do to help?

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:05.910
<i>You're going to destroy the big guy here.</i>

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:08.220
If we could, we'd...

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:09.110
<i>You can.</i>

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:12.190
This is the Château de Tiffauges.

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:17.040
A world destructor that can dissect
 the world, if I so desire.

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:19.440
I did hear one of them say it...

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:26.060
It's going to take a little more time before 
the power of a god becomes complete.

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:30.400
<i>We'll need to put all our chips in 
the pot with the time we have left.</i>

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.480
<i>You need to destroy Shem-ha,
the divine power.</i>

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:36.000
And we'll...

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:39.490
...save the girl who is its vessel.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.250
It's a two-part plan.

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.740
<i>You failed.</i>

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:47.200
Please don't be too hard on them.

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:52.840
This was unexpected, but the power of 
the god continues to properly manifest.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.790
This is the final battle.

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:58.680
We'll do everything possible
 to get rid of the intruders.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.160
<i>Of course you will.</i>

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:04.390
<i>That's why I gave you that rare blood.</i>

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:06.270
We know.

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:07.980
So please...

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:10.410
When we attain the power of the gods,

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:12.720
do what we want and make us human again—

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:15.370
That old bastard!

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:19.580
We'll just have to do it!

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:25.300
Yeah. We'll show them that we 
can win in a head-on fight, too!

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:33.620
Before long, the power 
of a god will be mine.

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:38.100
A way to deal with the threat 
posed by the god-killer...

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:51.100
I can't be your friend after all, Hibiki.

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:54.170
Don't go!

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.440
Don't go, Miku!

00:09:57.590 --> 00:10:00.400
Miku is leaving me!

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:23.350
Looks like that big, ugly thing outside the 
fortress is a massive ball of energy.

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:28.030
The purpose of the ritual is 
to use her as its vessel.

00:10:28.430 --> 00:10:33.500
If we forcibly remove her from 
the altar, we might destroy her!

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:38.740
It's going to be a pain, but we'll have to 
follow the steps to shut down the ritual.

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:40.710
What's wrong?

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:47.630
I'm just surprised. I don't really
 know you at all yet, do I?

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:53.630
That's not it! This is just a chance to get 
some people I don't like indebted to me.

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:55.370
Right!

00:10:55.940 --> 00:10:57.300
Now, then...

00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:00.890
It looks like they've arrived.

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:02.920
I'll get to work, too.

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:11.590
<i>The Wielders have arrived at 
the Château de Tiffauges!</i>

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:13.600
<i>Beginning the mission.</i>

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:19.010
The finished LiNKER and 
the training we did...

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:21.400
...were all for today!

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:26.930
<i>Mankind has always sensed the workings of 
the divine in the mechanisms of the world.</i>

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:30.470
<i>Many times, the world and the divine 
have been worshiped equally.</i>

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:35.740
<i>The Château is capable of dissecting that 
concept, allowing you to fight back.</i>

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:38.300
It's a type of philosophical weapon...

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:42.710
But can the Château generate 
the energy required?

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:44.440
<i>Nope.</i>

00:11:44.440 --> 00:11:49.930
<i>But the Château de Tiffauges is a 
megastructure comprised of multiple relics.</i>

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:54.380
<i>That means it should be easy to devise 
another way to generate the power required.</i>

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:57.570
Phonic gain.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:02.490
<i>It wasn't designed to operate that way, 
so I can't guarantee it will work.</i>

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:04.680
We can do it! We will do it!

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:09.140
We're stronger than we used to be! 
Let's show them that!

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:14.460
But activating a relic of that size...

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:16.790
Even with five of us, it's going to be tough.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:23.510
Yes. But we have a way to increase our 
phonic gain by putting our lives on the line.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.280
Our Climax Songs.

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.360
<i>You're ready, right?</i>

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:31.810
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:42.570
<i>Gatrandis babel ziggurat edenal.</i>

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:50.190
<i>Emustolronzen fine el baral zizzl</i>

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:59.330
<i>Gatrandis babel ziggurat edenal.</i>

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:09.470
<i>Emustolronzen fine el zizzl.</i>

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:19.320
Phonic gain is rising exponentially!

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:19.980
But...

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:23.730
There's still no response from 
the Château de Tiffauges.

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:31.460
Our enhanced compatibility coefficients 
are lessening the backfire...

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.780
But we won't last long!

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.390
Why?

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:39.350
Why aren't you doing anything, 
Château de Tiffauges?

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:45.010
Are you saying that even our greatest 
strength isn't worth answering?

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:48.350
<i>Even if their phonic gain 
isn't as strong as mine,</i>

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:51.380
<i>they should be able to increase it
 by working together.</i>

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:54.780
<i>So why does missing just one person...</i>

00:13:54.780 --> 00:13:56.840
Is it perhaps because...

00:13:57.490 --> 00:13:59.370
Looks like I have problems of my own.

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:12.920
You could've just run.

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:16.990
Since you've come here, you must either have 
some important reason for fighting,

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:19.380
or some new way to fight.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:21.040
Both!

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:28.380
I was expecting something more.

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:29.970
Single-minded idiots.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.470
We're not strong!

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.650
We're weak and tiny monsters!

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:43.150
But even so, we don't want to give up
 on tomorrow because we're weak!

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.000
Caught you!

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:56.800
Become lost in a labyrinth of philosophy!

00:15:01.190 --> 00:15:02.400
What's this...

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:13.010
Shem-ha's defensive systems...

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:16.390
It noticed us before we activated 
the Château de Tiffauges?

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:25.900
Guys!

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:27.900
They avoided a direct hit!

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.610
But Shem-ha is preparing another attack!

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:39.790
We won't let anyone stop the 
divine power from being completed.

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:44.310
What is this?

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:46.910
This is bad news!

00:15:58.460 --> 00:15:59.780
Guys!

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:03.970
How did she destroy the 
Philosophical Labyrinth?

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:08.950
I simply sang.

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:12.160
You sang?

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:14.140
Yeah.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:23.120
My song's phonic gain exceeds 
that of all seven billion humans!

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:34.230
Guys...

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:36.930
Restarting mission control at full strength!

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:41.170
What happened to Carol?

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:44.700
That used a lot of my power.

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:46.410
It's up to your power now...

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:47.150
Carol?

00:16:48.180 --> 00:16:50.610
That's right. I need to rescue Miku-san!

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:52.820
I won't let you...

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:59.900
This sickness... Is it...

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:01.600
Correct.

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:05.780
It is the duty of the protectors, the Kazanari,

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:08.760
to protect Japan from all foreign enemies.

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:11.760
Fudou!

00:17:20.710 --> 00:17:23.860
We couldn't activate the 
Château de Tiffauges!

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:34.910
With this light that we've given form to...

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.770
Yukine! Maria!

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:27.500
But we, your support staff...

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:30.220
...still believe that moment will come!

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.230
So...

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:45.260
Humanity's ultimate weapon, 
the god-killing fist!

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:50.190
My friend... Miku... is going 
to leave me if I don't go!

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:52.970
It's impossible! Your wounds haven't healed!

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:54.890
I'm fine! Just fine!

00:18:54.890 --> 00:19:00.590
If I can't save my friend, 
then why do I wield a Symphogear?

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:02.490
Gungnir!

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:18.760
Protect Tachibana!

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:22.220
Use your lives as shields, and protect hope!

00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:24.010
Let's go, everyone!

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:15.400
Go, dummy!

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:27.330
The forbidden Amalgam?!

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:30.000
This is an emergency. I'll make sure 
you get off with house arrest!

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.490
Don't miss your chance!

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:56.280
The shortest and fastest route...

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:57.650
Straight ahead...

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:02.920
In a straight line!

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:12.960
No... It's not sending the power 
into Miku-san as a vessel.

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:16.660
The great power is going 
to absorb Miku-san...

00:21:17.030 --> 00:21:19.340
Miku!

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:31.770
Why... are you here?

00:21:58.430 --> 00:21:59.530
Miku!

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:02.140
How upsetting.

00:22:02.140 --> 00:22:09.290
Know that I am Shem-ha, the one who man 
worships as the god of this planet.
